<title>USA: Gulf Canada Resources sells US$225 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Gulf Canada Resources sells US$225 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Yankee note issue from Gulf Canada Resources Ltd was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources Ltd is a large independent petroleum exploration and production company, located in Calgary, Alberta.</p>
<p>BORROWER GULF CANADA RESOURCES LTD</p>
<p>AMT US$225 MLN     COUPON 8.25 PCT   MATURITY 3/15/2017</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.851  FIRST PAY DATE 9/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA1   YIELD 8.265 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD 125 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
